get.description:
The global tool registry, in three families:

- **builtin** — the clickable list; they run inside an agent run, never via
  `/invoke`;
- **platform** — workspace capabilities (create a project, a dataset, an
  ontology, commit a file). Bound to no resource, and `writes` says which
  of them change something;
- **resource_tools** — the generic capabilities of each bindable type;
- **skills** — the built-in skill library shipped with the image, which
  an agent's `skills:` may name next to the project's own skills.
